{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月23日握手会後に生誕祭をして頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのお花に、握手会ブースも沢山の飾り物...すごく幸せでした。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙はzoo(高山一実)が読んでくれました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読みながら涙を流してるzooをみて泣きそうなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔から悩みとか話すことが苦手で\nでもzooにはなんでも話すことが出来て..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度もお家に行ってはお話をして、\nお好み焼き食べに行こう！\nって誘ってくれたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼き鳥も食べに行って、ディズニーやユニバにも行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お泊まりも沢山して！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって本当のお姉ちゃんみたいな存在なんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"zooが手紙を読んでくれたあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギューってした時に、今までのこととか思い出して目頭があつくなったけど\n我慢したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントにありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭をしてくだた方、飾り、絵本、バッチに。。たくさんを時間をかけてしてくれて、忙しい中 してくれたんだと思うとホントに感謝の気持ちでいっぱいになります..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅い時間なのに生誕祭きてくださった方や、コメントをくださった方、ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこれからも真っ直ぐに上を向いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を向上させていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝えられない気持ちは 行動で見せて行きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目に見えない素敵な気持ちや、プレゼント、お手紙 もありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして19歳を迎えることが出来て幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46大好き！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザインしたTシャツ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒は似合う人多いかなと思って着やすいような色とデザインにしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも一番の見てほしいところは背後のデザイン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮るの忘れたからまた載せるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校を卒業したので少し背伸びをして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショル"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽいですか⁉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似たような服だよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてあみちゃんの舞台見に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初から最後まで笑ってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで一番好き！面白い舞台でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんがんばれー！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前に広島のテレビ、鯉の花シアターに出させて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが最多出演とのこと！ビックリだけど嬉しいです！\nもっと地元に呼んでもらえるように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nのぎ英語、今回は さゆにゅんが登場です！\n再放送が5月6日にあるので見てくださいね〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウィークは何して過ごしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/01/2739818/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}